{"v":3,"catch":"由「BRAVELY」系列和《OCTOPATH TRAVELER 歧路旅人》\n開發團隊打造的全新戰略RPG於Nintendo Switch發售。\n一部以HD-2D的精美畫面描繪的英雄傳。","desc":"SQUARE ENIX精心打造的全新戰略RPG。\n以HD-2D的精美畫面呈現壯闊的故事，以及如同往昔戰略遊戲般富含深度的戰鬥。\n故事舞台為陷入戰亂的諾澤利亞大陸，玩家將不得不做出艱難的抉擇。\n遊戲中的各種選擇與行動都會累積基於「BENEFIT」、「MORAL」、「FREEDOM」三種價值觀的「信念」，並影響劇情的分歧及加入我方陣營的角色。\n你的正義將會邁向什麼樣的未來……？","publisher":"SQUARE ENIX","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["角色扮演","策略","模擬","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 7.6GB / Switch 7.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe02407d0af20a0690fa90e7897de79c71cd4b6a664a5f18d7c5550211f0776b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d06f726491dba1a1eb772e04a85515d01d049deb84814a30d710c33e4697441b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff0b742f8220d5ab00a7f388f388cf00c6e9821f65fe826ea96209c740abfcd5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34651d38113631210f7b9f1609e0e671c3b562a3000a68f26804359d0c8a687d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c3d17445b93b70db482a9b2e48f882640d4ff7b2a956bb6dfa98442cbb33a2ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/02ffa358bf72651cc4a2bf9c3745ab58a372bbb4663d61cba77da6910debda39.jpg"],"titleId":"01008c90140d0000","dlc":[]}